---
import Card from "./Card/index.astro";
---

<Card colSpan="md:col-span-1" rowSpan="md:row-span-6" title="About me">
  <div class="flex flex-col gap-4">
    <p class="text-sm font-light leading-relaxed text-gray-800 dark:text-white">
      Sophomore CS student at <span class="font-semibold text-orange-600 dark:text-orange-400">Clemson University</span> studying data engineering and cloud systems.
    </p>
    <div>
      <h3 class="text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 mb-2">Tech Stack</h3>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-2 text-sm">
        <div class="space-y-1">
          <p class="text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300">• Python, Java, Ruby</p>
          <p class="text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300">• Svelte, Astro, React</p>
          <p class="text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300">• AWS, Azure, OVHcloud</p>
        </div>
        <div class="space-y-1">
          <p class="text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300">• Proxmox, Docker, ZFS</p>
          <p class="text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300">• Prometheus, Grafana</p>
          <p class="text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300">• UniFi Networking</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <p class="text-sm font-light leading-relaxed text-gray-800 dark:text-white">
      I run a self-hosted Proxmox cluster (256GB RAM, dual RTX 2080 Supers) for local LLM inference and infrastructure experimentation.
    </p>
    <p class="text-sm font-light leading-relaxed text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">
      Building production-grade self-hosted systems that reduce cloud dependency while maintaining enterprise-level reliability.
    </p>
  </div>
</Card>
